            "title": "Strathcona's Waterous confident on MEG Energy response to sweetened offer",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "CALGARY (Reuters) -The executive chair of Canadian oil company Strathcona Resources told Reuters he is confident his newly sweetened offer to buy MEG Energy will be enough to clinch a heated bidding war, in which a key decision\u00a0is expected by Monday.  Calgary-based MEG Energy has said it will respond on or before September 15 to the revised offer Strathcona made earlier this week to acquire the company, which is Canada's last remaining pure-play oil sands producer.  Under the terms of an existing agreement with larger company Cenovus Energy, MEG must determine whether Strathcona's new bid is superior to the deal it has already entered into with Cenovus.",
